                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiramu akasema tena, Na ahimidiwe BWANA, Mungu wa Israeli, aliyezifanya mbingu na nchi, ambaye amempa mfalme Daudi mwana wa hekima, mwenye busara na akili, ili amjengee BWANA nyumba, na nyumba kwa ufalme wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.12",
